   "html": "The integrand is $(φ - 1)/m'$, not $[φ - 1]m'$: $\\ln γ_\\pm = φ - 1 + \\int_0^m \\dfrac{φ - 1}{m'}\\,dm'$, the form Section 24.7 prints for a solute's activity coefficient."
  }
